{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想同時掌握跑步成績與跑鞋損耗，可留意《Your PB Tracker》。它把個人最佳成績、分段配速與裝備里程追蹤整合於一身，適合備戰 5K、馬拉松或日常步行健身的使用者，並透過 Apple Health 讀取訓練紀錄。原價 US $0.99，目前限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-30.webp\">\n<h2>自動記錄最佳成績與跑鞋裡程</h2>\n<p>《Your PB Tracker》與 Apple Health 同步，自動找出 1 公里至馬拉松等標準距離的最快時間，並可按跑步或步行類型及日期篩選。每課練習的平均分段與配速拆解清晰，方便對比歷史表現。程式同時統計各對跑鞋裡程，跑步與步行距離分開顯示，達 80% 損耗即提醒更換，可自訂 200 至 800 公里壽命目標。健康數據留在裝置內，一次付費即可用盡全部功能。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-34.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-35.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-36.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-64-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-65-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-66-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Your PB Tracker</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T16:40:40.399954+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":385,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T16:30:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T20:54:26.223269+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T16:37:41.907451+00:00","content_hash":"e42435697be5b1e4c9eee0b7206e1d5848e968d34a3ed50ab515958c4ede8fd8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}